# Sensitive paths: they mark who to request a review from. Replace @your-org/owners with your team or user.
# Note: if agents open PRs with the owner's account, GitHub does not let that account approve its own PR,
# so do not make CODEOWNERS approval mandatory in that setup.
/backend/migrations/ @your-org/owners
/shared/schemas/ @your-org/owners
/.github/ @your-org/owners
/.claude/ @your-org/owners
/AGENTS.md @your-org/owners
/CLAUDE.md @your-org/owners
